e]\n• [Organize your games by date, league, or night out]\n• Sync privately across your iPhone and iPad with iCloud\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nYour scores stay yours. Everything is stored on your device and, if you choose, synced through your own iCloud account. No account to create, no ads, no tracking — Lanesnap doesn't collect your personal data.\nWhether you bowl in a weekly league or just for fun on the weekend, Lanesnap keeps a clean record of every game, right in your pocket.", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "DE", "JA", "KO", "PT", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes": "2317312", "formattedPrice": "무료", "trackContentRating": "4+", "trackId": 6785145368, "trackName": "Lanesnap", "userRatingCount": 0}]}